The bounded HTTP body reader is adapted from sailry-code commit 67ae9fa0,
services/pairing-relay/src/worker.ts, a Sailry-owned source previously
distributed under the GNU GPL version 3. Its copyright owner releases this
adaptation, with the rest of the pairing relay, under AGPL-3.0-only; see LICENSE.
The old multi-step SPAKE2 mailbox is not included.
The current service implements the user-approved six-digit, sixty-second,
single-use ticket exchange. Rust Link owns device pairing and persistent trust.
